REGENT OF REJANG LEBONG
BENGKULU PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION OF REJANG LEBONG REGENCY
NUMBER 4 YEAR 2015
CONCERNING
PREVENTION AND HANDLING OF VIOLENCE
AGAINST WOMEN AND CHILDREN
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
REGENT OF REJANG LEBONG,

Considering : a. that in order to guarantee the rights of women and children to participate optimally in accordance with human dignity and worth, and to receive protection from violence, discrimination and other violations of the rights of women and children, it is necessary to undertake efforts to prevent and handle violence against women and children.
b. that in order for the efforts to prevent and handle violence against women and children to obtain optimal results, and to be implemented quickly, in a planned, integrated, comprehensive and organized manner by involving all related elements in the region, it is necessary to have regulations concerning the prevention and handling of violence against women and children who are victims of violence.
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letters a and b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Prevention and Handling of Violence Against Women and Children.

In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 28 Year 1959 concerning the Stipulation of Emergency Law Number 4 Year 1956 (State Gazette Year 1956 Number 55), Emergency Law Number 5 Year 1956 (State Gazette Year 1956 Number 56) and Emergency Law Number 6 Year 1956 (State Gazette Year 1956 Number 57) concerning the Establishment of Level II Regions Including Municipalities, Within the Level I Region of South Sumatra, As Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1959 Number 73, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1821);
